1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,286
Topi jerami… tali merah…

2
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:05,442
Jangan dorong Kakak…

3
00:00:05,511 --> 00:00:06,158
Dorong Kakak?

4
00:00:06,437 --> 00:00:06,956
Siapa?

5
00:00:07,402 --> 00:00:08,069
Obatnya jadi!

6
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:09,954
Demamnya parah,

7
00:00:10,014 --> 00:00:11,216
nggak mempan.

8
00:00:11,552 --> 00:00:13,288
Di desa tak ada tabib.

9
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:14,622
Kota lagi jam malam,

10
00:00:14,938 --> 00:00:16,224
gerbang tutup.

11
00:00:17,032 --> 00:00:18,200
Sejam perjalanan,

12
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:19,234
dia nggak kuat.

13
00:00:21,469 --> 00:00:23,064
Misi darurat:

14
00:00:23,358 --> 00:00:27,132
sebelum fajar, demam Xiaohe turun.

15
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:29,841
Kasih aku kudanya.

16
00:00:30,395 --> 00:00:31,575
Aku percaya kamu.

17
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:35,049
Kak A-Ling bisa berkuda?!

18
00:00:35,386 --> 00:00:36,934
Itu gaya kavaleri.

19
00:00:37,011 --> 00:00:37,906
Siapa dia sebenarnya?

20
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,517
Jalan Timur, Tabib Bai!

21
00:00:50,055 --> 00:00:50,730
Jam malam!

22
00:00:50,784 --> 00:00:52,293
Ada perampok, balik!

23
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,128
Cewek kok naik kuda!

24
00:00:54,203 --> 00:00:54,743
Minggir.

25
00:00:55,403 --> 00:00:57,046
Maju lagi, kutangkap!

26
00:01:02,077 --> 00:01:02,732
Pemanah!

27
00:01:02,857 --> 00:01:03,353
Kejar!

28
00:01:05,531 --> 00:01:06,871
Kak…

29
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:08,755
Diminum!

30
00:01:09,257 --> 00:01:09,739
Kakak di sini.

31
00:01:09,802 --> 00:01:11,155
Bertahan sampai A-Ling pulang.

32
00:01:13,457 --> 00:01:14,077
Tabib Bai!

33
00:01:14,333 --> 00:01:15,202
Buka!

34
00:01:15,262 --> 00:01:17,699
Iya, iya,

35
00:01:18,819 --> 00:01:20,859
berisik amat.

36
00:01:22,486 --> 00:01:23,137
Diam!

37
00:01:27,686 --> 00:01:29,467
Pemanah, bidik dia.

38
00:01:31,852 --> 00:01:32,356
Tembak—
